        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVFAV-DB, Fifth Avenue Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis traditionally styled deadbolt from Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware is not just fashionable, it offers great security. Forged from solid brass, it has a 1\" deadbolt with a hardened steel core and the door strike is reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security. Available as single cylinder (keyed lock on the outside with thumb turn inside) or a double cylinder (keyed lock on both outside and inside). It features a low profile lock cylinder projection (only 0.63\"). Easy to install, the Fifth Avenue Deadbolt fits doors 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-fifth-avenue-series\"><b>Fifth Avenue Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur FAVFAV-DB Fifth Avenue Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur FAVFAV-DB Fifth Avenue Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Height: 3.46\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Width: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur Deadbolt Exploded View (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FAV-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fifth Avenue Deadbolt",
                "description": "Grandeur FAVFAV-DB, Fifth Avenue Deadbolt - This traditionally styled deadbolt from Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware is not just fashionable, it offers great security. Forged from solid brass, it has a 1 inch deadbolt with a hardened steel core and the door strike is reinforced with 3 inch screws for extra security. Available as single cylinder (keyed lock on the outside with thumb turn inside) or a double cylinder (keyed lock on both outside and inside). It features a low profile lock cylinder projection (only 0.63 inch). Easy to install the Fifth Avenue Deadbolt fits doors 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
                "keywords": "Grandeur FAVFAV-DB Contemporary Deadbolts, grandeur fifth avenue deadbolts, 5th ave deadbolts, single cylinder deadbolts, double cylinder deadbolts, grandeur deadbolts, Grandeur fifth avenue series,  Grandeur FAVFAV-DB, GRA-FAVFAV-DB-LB,"
